<title>GERMANY: Vereinsbank's Schmidt-can't confirm job cut plans.</title>
<headline>Vereinsbank's Schmidt-can't confirm job cut plans.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Albrecht Schmidt, chief executive of Bayerische Vereinsbank AG, said he could not confirm that Vereinsbank and Hypobank planned to cut 5,000 to 7,000 jobs over five years as a result of the merger.</p>
<p>Earlier, sources said plans foresaw a cut of this size in the workforce.</p>
<p>Schmidt was speaking at a news conference in Munich to announce details of the merger plans.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
